  "comment": "The images of the test database servers and of the service runner that make orm-test-container starts as a Compose project of bay (scripts/test-servers-container.mts). Each image is pinned by the digest of its index; version names the release the digest holds. make orm-install-container-images pulls them with bay pull, and no start pulls one. runner declares what runner-setup.sh installs in the runner: the packages of Debian, and the sha256 of the node tarball of mise.toml and of rustup-init for each processor that uname -m names. bay pins the release of bay that CI installs: its version, the address of its files, and the sha256 of the archive of each platform from SHA256SUMS of that release; make orm-install-bay installs it into var/tools/bay, and no run reads it.",
